__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log
runs/
*.db
*.sqlite

# Operational handover material stays local. It names live processes, pids, panes, a
# schedule and this machine, and the repository is public: see docs/PUBLIC-SAFETY.md
# and tools/public_safety.py, which enforces the same list in content and in names.
NIGHT-*
night-snapshot-*/
night-snapshot-*
snapshot-*/

# The morning page is written for the operator and dated for the day it was written: it
# restates the state of the machine at that hour and is stale by the next one. It stays
# on disk as a working document and off the repo, because it is a snapshot of the run,
# not research.
docs/morning.html

# Credentials and key material never belong in a public repository.
.env
*.env
*.pem
*.key
*_deploy_*
id_rsa*
id_dsa*
id_ecdsa*
id_ed25519*

# Scratch space: work in progress, patches and logs that are not evidence.
tmp/
scratch/

# Solana key material (added by SOLANA-INSTALL-AND-TEST). A keypair file is the
# secret itself: 64 integers in JSON. Kept out of the repo by name here, and by
# shape in .public-denylist, which is the check that actually runs before a commit.
authority*.json
*keypair*.json
**/authority*.json
**/*keypair*.json

# Rust build products for the on-chain program (added by ONCHAIN-WIRE). `target/` holds the
# .so and `cap_hook-keypair.json`, which is the secret that owns the program id: neither is
# ever committed. The keypair is refused again by shape in .public-denylist.
programs/cap_hook/target/
**/target/deploy/

# 64 KB of dependency pins that `cargo-build-sbf` regenerates on every machine that builds the
# program. Kept on disk for a reproducible local build, out of the tree because it is a
# generated artefact of the toolchain, not source.
programs/cap_hook/Cargo.lock

# A rehearsal, not evidence (added by ONCHAIN-WIRE). `tools/devnet_publish.py --local` writes
# this and the console refuses to render it as devnet; keeping it out of the tree means it
# cannot be mistaken for the real artefact by a reader who does not run the code.
records/devnet-artefacts.local.json
